ZOyuiWiEhL_z_wQ&oe=6A6CB07E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Quest_TrailerCover_New_Prologue.png", "id": "746931301813632", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307346_746931305146965_4581551427396201633_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ywia5sVbNBUQ7kNvwGboNDB&_nc_oc=AdrNVFnMNLHHkp0UzdcSLZC615Nj2qfr_UicJRmMyGCBtSickw7iI9Bmdc3Z0j2zTJ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA3NXCFA0owVUAm8LIoP4XsDlDJHnZFnzCHFdT-POjbpA&oe=6A6CA572"}, "display_name": "Legendary Tales - Prologue", "keywords": ["Legendary", "coop", "Multiplay", "rpg", "physics"], "long_description": "This is the Prologue of Legendary Tales that gamers can enjoy the world of Legendary Tales.\nThat has most of features of full game has.\nYou can find full game by searching \"Legendary Tales\" on the store.\n\nAre you looking for a VR Action RPG?\n\nLegendary Tales is a full-scale VR action RPG designed to deliver deep progression, physical combat, and true cooperative adventure. Built exclusively for immersive VR, every action is controlled by your own movement, from weapon swings to spellcasting.\n\n# Physics\n{1795729151117982}\n\n# Combat\n{1414109443398593}\nEngage in intense physics-based combat where weapons have real weight, momentum, and collision. \n\n# Skill\n{1428524785651015}\nProgress your character through a deep skill tree system that allows you to define your own playstyle. Specialize as a warrior, rogue, mage, or create hybrid builds by freely combining skills. Every choice shapes how you fight.\n\n\n# Dungeon\n{1676874987053178}\n# Discover item\n{4288780974723472}\nExplore dangerous dungeons filled with enemies, traps, and powerful loot. Items are generated with random attributes, ensuring that every run feels fresh and rewarding. Discover rare gear, optimize your build, and continuously chase better equipment.\n\n# Crafting\n{870012972471435}\nCrafting plays a key role in your journey. Collect materials, craft weapons and improve your gear to prepare for tougher challenges ahead. \n\n# Multiplay\n{906804265260441}\nLegendary Tales can be played solo or in online co-op with friends. Team up to clear dungeons together, coordinate attacks in real time, share loot. Cooperation, communication, and synergy turn each adventure into a memorable story.", "short_description": "This is Prologue of Legendary Tales that gamers can enjoy the world of Legendary Tales.\nWhat is Legendary tales? It is a VR Action roleplaying game with up to 4 player co-op. Collect items, enhance your abilities and fight your way through an ever changing dungeon to make your own Legendary Tales."}]}, "developer_name": "Urban Wolf Games Inc,", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://urbanwolfgames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Urban Wolf Games Inc,", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://urbanwolfgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja", "ko", "es", "cs", "it", "ru", "pl", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25560255830333412"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1580607459937733"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1580607459937733"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": 